#
# `import QtMultimedia 5.x` on Qt 6. Qt looks up the version-qualified
# directory QtMultimedia.5 before Qt 6's own QtMultimedia, so Qt 5 imports get
# these Qt 5 API wrappers over Qt 6 Multimedia, while `import QtMultimedia 6.x`
# (and an unversioned import) is unaffected. Only the subset in README.md is
# provided (no Radio, Playlist, Torch).
module QtMultimedia
MediaPlayer 5.0 MediaPlayer.qml
Audio 5.0 MediaPlayer.qml
VideoOutput 5.0 VideoOutput.qml
SoundEffect 5.0 SoundEffect.qml
Camera 5.0 Camera.qml
CameraCapture 5.0 CameraCapture.qml
CameraExposure 5.0 CameraExposure.qml
CameraFlash 5.0 CameraFlash.qml
CameraFocus 5.0 CameraFocus.qml
CameraImageProcessing 5.0 CameraImageProcessing.qml
CameraMetaData 5.0 CameraMetaData.qml
CameraRecorder 5.0 CameraRecorder.qml
CameraViewfinder 5.5 CameraViewfinder.qml
internal CameraBackend CameraBackend.qml
singleton QtMultimedia 5.4 QtMultimediaGlobal.qml
